{"articleNo":"582884","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=582884&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [평생교육원]생성형 AI로 완성하는 실전 취업 포트폴리오 교육 참여자 모집","writer":"평생교육원","writeDate":"2026.11.20","hit":"2","attachments":[{"name":"생성형 AI 교육신청서.hwpx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=582884&attachNo=169679"},{"name":"개인정보 수집,이용 동의서.hwpx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=582884&attachNo=169680"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHoEZsgpAxgdQFoE8DSAhAsgeQBsBVZAMwAsBhQgSQBN0BbAOgAcA7AcyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">구미시와 국립금오공과대학교가 함께 하는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\"</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">일자리 모두 잡고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(JOB GO) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\"</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">생성형 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">AI</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">로 완성하는 실전 취업 포트폴리오 교육 참여자를 모집합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육과정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">생성형 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">AI</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">를 활용한 취업 역량 강화 및 실전 포트폴리오 제작</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2026. 12. 9.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 12. 17.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육시간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">~</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">13:00 ~ 17:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육장소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">국립금오공과대학교 신평동캠퍼스 평생교육원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육비용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">전액 무료</span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">모집기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2026. 12. 4.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">모집인원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">선착순 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">8. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">신청방법</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>&nbsp;-첨부파일을 다운받아 작성 후 담당자 메일(kma0298@kumoh.ac.kr)로 접수&nbsp;</b></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">9. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">문 의 처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">☎ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">054)478-7246</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"13379\"></div></div><div><br style=\"font-family: 돋움;\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
